{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell the story of a boy during World War II who breaks through the siege with strong willpower. No matter what kind of predicament he faces or where he finds himself, he firmly believes that as long as he moves towards the light and carries hope in his heart, he will find the strength to move forward. He searches for hope in adversity, persistence in the source of his dreams, and the driving force behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Jam is a Roguelike game, an adventure level-based game featuring TPS, and RPG elements. Pick up randomly-dropped weapons with random affixes. Fight your way to the final boss and escape or continue your run indefinitely to see just how long you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is random; each new restart is a brand-new experience. You will meet different heroes and experience new weapons, items, checkpoints, and unique combat rhythms throughout the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772820?t=1768962048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772820/dfebde873102435e27a9c113fdf094be8d3eedf7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768962048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772820/853f7e1dd53eb3483732bf9dd18d6e4ed9ae42fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768962048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772820/853f7e1dd53eb3483732bf9dd18d6e4ed9ae42fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768962048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing"